<title>USA: United Technologies Corp Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>United Technologies Corp Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.94		    $1.60</p>
<p> Net			254,000		  210,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,939,000		5,651,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 130,365		  130,813</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $5.14		    $4.28</p>
<p> Net			677,000		  563,000</p>
<p> Revs		  17,374,000	     16,835,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 130,800		  130,414</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: After giving effect to the 2-for-1 stock split announced on September 30, 1996, earnings per share for the third quarters of 1996 and 1995 will be $0.97 and $0.80, respectively. Earnings per share for the nine month periods of 1996 and 1995 will be $2.57 and $2.14, respectively.</p>
</text>
